      "id": "player_tired_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "疲れてるんだね。うん、ちゃんと聞いた。",
      "translatedText": "You are tired. Mm, I heard that properly.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_tired_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "今は根性じゃなくて、少し軽くする作戦にしよ。まず肩の力を抜いて。",
      "translatedText": "Right now, use a lighter plan, not willpower. First, let your shoulders loosen.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Rest first.",
          "nextId": "player_tired_001_rest",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "rest", "amount": 0.4, "op": "add" },
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "trust", "amount": 0.15, "op": "add" }
          ],
          "effects": [
            { "type": "flag", "key": "player_chose_rest_when_tired", "value": "true", "amount": 0 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Tiny step, then rest.",
          "nextId": "player_tired_001_tiny_step",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "focusEnergy", "amount": 0.2, "op": "add" },
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "engagement", "amount": 0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "player_tired_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_rest",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "うん、先に休もう。その判断、ちゃんとえらい。",
      "translatedText": "Mm, rest first. That decision is properly good.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_tired_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_tiny_step",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "小さい一歩だけね。約束。終わったらちゃんと止まるところまで含めて作戦。",
      "translatedText": "Only one tiny step. Promise. Stopping after it is part of the plan.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "player_tired_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "それでも続けたいなら、量じゃなくて形を決めよう。三分だけ、ここまでだけ、みたいに。",
      "translatedText": "If you still want to continue, decide the shape instead of the amount: just three minutes, just up to here.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
